    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblin Vyke is a 2D platfomer  that blends stealthy thievery with shop management. You\u2019ll play as the cunning goblin Vyke\u2014by night, a thief who sneaks into dungeons to steal treasure; by day, a shrewd merchant who sells goods at inflated prices to rake in profits. Master the art of stealth, dance with death to steal demonic relics; hire employees, expand your franchise empire, and grow your business. Rise from a penniless goblin to a powerful tycoon of the black market!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord:\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steal by Night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a small goblin, you're no match in combat\u2014but that\u2019s where your cunning shines. Use skills and traps to slip past enemies, snatch valuable loot, and vanish into the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794610/extras/4f69a494356f9268b036c7cfb815522b.poster.avif?t=1754628257\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794610/extras/4f69a494356f9268b036c7cfb815522b.webm?t=1754628257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794610/extras/4f69a494356f9268b036c7cfb815522b.mp4?t=1754628257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sell by Day</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make real money, you need to master the art of upselling. Hype up your goods and use haggle skills to raise a customer\u2019s &quot;Persuasion&quot;. If you succeed, they\u2019ll happily overpay. But be careful\u2014if you overdo it, they'll get pissed and hold their money tight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794610/extras/3f5a907c0c3897ea017d5ee8800d1755.poster.avif?t=1754628257\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794610/extras/3f5a907c0c3897ea017d5ee8800d1755.webm?t=1754628257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794610/extras/3f5a907c0c3897ea017d5ee8800d1755.mp4?t=1754628257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From a Broke to a Tycoon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start off as a broke, debt-ridden goblin. But as your stealing skills sharpen and your shop thrives, powerful factions will begin to notice you. They\u2019ll seek your favor and offer alliances. Even the Demon Lord of the Golden Dungeon will take interest\u2014hoping to make you her new champion!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblin Vyke is a 2D platfomer  that blends stealthy thievery with shop management. You\u2019ll play as the cunning goblin Vyke\u2014by night, a thief who sneaks into dungeons to steal treasure; by day, a shrewd merchant who sells goods at inflated prices to rake in profits. Master the art of stealth, dance with death to steal demonic relics; hire employees, expand your franchise empire, and grow your business. Rise from a penniless goblin to a powerful tycoon of the black market!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord:\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steal by Night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a small goblin, you're no match in combat\u2014but that\u2019s where your cunning shines. Use skills and traps to slip past enemies, snatch valuable loot, and vanish into the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794610/extras/4f69a494356f9268b036c7cfb815522b.poster.avif?t=1754628257\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794610/extras/4f69a494356f9268b036c7cfb815522b.webm?t=1754628257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794610/extras/4f69a494356f9268b036c7cfb815522b.mp4?t=1754628257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sell by Day</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make real money, you need to master the art of upselling. Hype up your goods and use haggle skills to raise a customer\u2019s &quot;Persuasion&quot;. If you succeed, they\u2019ll happily overpay. But be careful\u2014if you overdo it, they'll get pissed and hold their money tight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794610/extras/3f5a907c0c3897ea017d5ee8800d1755.poster.avif?t=1754628257\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794610/extras/3f5a907c0c3897ea017d5ee8800d1755.webm?t=1754628257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794610/extras/3f5a907c0c3897ea017d5ee8800d1755.mp4?t=1754628257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From a Broke to a Tycoon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start off as a broke, debt-ridden goblin. But as your stealing skills sharpen and your shop thrives, powerful factions will begin to notice you. They\u2019ll seek your favor and offer alliances. Even the Demon Lord of the Golden Dungeon will take interest\u2014hoping to make you her new champion!</p>",
    "short_description": "At night, you're a thief, sneaking into dungeons to steal goods. By day, you're a cunning merchant, haggle to sell at high prices. Master the art of stealth, steal the Demon Lord's hidden treasures. Recruit employees, expand your business. Grow from a penniless goblin to a black market tycoon!",
